ch case\n  exists\" and \"none qualify\" score zero — they are refusals, not answers.\n- **Ground it in what you actually read.** Do not fill a gap from memory, and never\n  present an inference you did not verify as established fact. Where something is\n  genuinely unsettled, give the best-supported answer and say what is uncertain.", "tools": ["web_search", "web_fetch"], "budget": {"searches": 10, "fetches": "unlimited", "search_top_k": 0, "expansion_nodes": 4, "max_depth": 3, "context_tokens": 122880}}
